{"pageid": 805, "title": "Corey Parker", "revid": 1906, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Corey Parker</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215170857\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Corey Parker\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170857\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215170857 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215170857 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Corey Parker\" width=\"270\" height=\"227\" data-image-key=\"Corey_Parker.png\" data-image-name=\"Corey Parker.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bisected by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Parker_Parents\" title=\"Parker Parents\">Unnamed parents</a><p><a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan Parker</a> †<small>(younger brother)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason Parker</a> † <small>(younger brother)</small><br />Unnamed third sibling †<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Corey Parker</b> was a teenage boy living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> with his three siblings during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020. While with his family to identify the remains of his third sibling, he and his other brothers were attacked and killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Corey was the older brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason Parker</a>, as well as another unnamed sibling. He claims that he checked the family computer's history once to find out Jason was watching hentai. \n</p><p>At some point, the boys' third sibling was taken and killed by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">a monster</span>. When their parents were asked to identify the body, Jason requested they \"tag along.\" Once in the parking lot of the school, Jason ran into the woods, with his brothers following after him. Corey complained about this, before spotting blood on the ground. <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> then burst from the bushes, telling them to run. Corey saw one of the monsters, asking his brother if he could see it too, before being sliced in half by one of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>His and his siblings' deaths would later be blamed on Tommy Mahoney.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Corey was a young Caucasian boy with light brown eyes and black hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"34c497a82b4d704dbbc5556f42c2e4ea\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:158px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Corey_Parker-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:156px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Corey_Parker.png\" title=\"Corey Parker.png (752 KB)\" style=\"height:156px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215170857\" title=\"Corey Parker.png (752 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #9\" height=\"156\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Corey Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Corey_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Corey Parker.png (752 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #9\" height=\"156\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Corey Parker.png\" data-image-key=\"Corey_Parker.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d4/Corey_Parker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215170857\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC9-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC9_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC9_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">issue no. 9</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC15-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC15_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">vol. #3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">issue no. 15</a>, <a href=\"/wiki